########################################################
# Init-script for CTK SparkD(CubeOS sys-init utility)  #
# Support CTK SparkD versions:                         #
# - v0.0.1-001-alpha prerelease;                       #
# - v0.0.1-002-alpha release;                          #
# This script can:                                     #
# - run programs;                                      #
# - close programs;                                    #
# - So, the end :) (because this is script for         #
#                                   alpha (pre)release)#
# Official CubeOS GitHub-repo:                         #
# https://github.com/cubeweb-lab/CubeOS                #
########################################################

block = serial:
start
    exec "/bin/csh"
end

# (For example:)
# block = serial:
# start
#   close pid=2
# end
